# Wave W17-V (Route 207): climb pine — a climb pine in bright foothill greens, tiered and sturdy, its crown clean in the mountain air with the highlight lifted clear of the turf, on climb turf (ground baked in). Route 207’s own tree — split from Route 204’s bluff pine by register (the climb pine climbs toward Apex, the bluff pine stands over a cave road) and from Route 208’s rest pine beside it by crown temperature: the climb is bright effort, the rest is warm ease.
